{"channelId":"UCfEABQkijMBefx7oLmbke2Q","row":["SURE FOOT Equine & Webinars With Wendy",8650,"SURE FOOT Equine Stability Program® | Horse Balance, Relaxation & Performance\n\nThe SURE FOOT Equine Stability Program® helps horses improve balance, relaxation, proprioception, and performance using SURE FOOT Pads.\n\nOn this channel, you’ll learn how to support your horse’s posture, movement, confidence, and long-term soundness—whether for training, rehabilitation, or everyday handling.\n\nSURE FOOT Pads give horses the opportunity to explore their own balance. As they become more aware of how they are organized over their feet, many horses show reduced tension, improved movement, and greater comfort.\n\nWendy Murdoch, creator of SURE FOOT, shares how to:\n\nIntroduce pads safely\nChoose the right pad types\nRead your horse’s responses\nImprove balance and body awareness\nSupport rehab, performance, and behavior\n\nUsed by horse owners, trainers, veterinarians, bodyworkers, and farriers, SURE FOOT helps horses become more relaxed, balanced, and confident.","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCfEABQkijMBefx7oLmbke2Q","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCfEABQkijMBefx7oLmbke2Q","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:09:42.421Z","channelId":"UCfEABQkijMBefx7oLmbke2Q","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"c2120528839d5dd265d0ccfcb0c3953bed5364f2fab69184fdbe36bc151c8d47","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"7f98d2562a362f6f5a08d3fa26b9914496336363013a877e0cecd3bbbde62441"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCfEABQkijMBefx7oLmbke2Q","observedAt":"2026-09-16T04:11:31.534Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCfEABQkijMBefx7oLmbke2Q","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":8650,"raw":"8.65K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCfEABQkijMBefx7oLmbke2Q","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:09:42.421Z"}],"e